abstract: >
  Research monorepo for CeMEPI Contencioso Tributário Fiscal (CTF) fronts:
  litigância (PEF↔FACE join diagnostics), monitoramento (arrecadação/estoque forecast),
  macro (BCB × painel), and garantias (API gap / cobrança proxies). Includes shared
  dump client, pipelines for the TJSP lake ops tree, notebooks, and grounded references.
  Large lake/dump files live outside git (LAKE_ROOT / DUMP_ROOT).
